# TR House Telvanni: joining at the Telvanni Council House in Port Telvannis, then "A Message from Vvardenfell"
# (TR_m1_HT_Ra1). Areth Morvayn, Mouth in the Chambers, takes the player in ("join House Telvanni": "Yes, I want to
# join." 2, then 1), sends the player for a report from Rathra's agent south of Bahrammu's main gate (10); the agent
# answers the password (Choice 1) and hands the report over (20); Areth pays for it (100).
# Morroblivion mode (TR_Mainland on Morrowind_ob); starts from morroblivion_main's save after the census exit.
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_mb_chargen_exit --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Vero Renim greets visitors at the Council House entrance with "Have you come to join House Telvanni?", which
# teaches the topic; he sends a worthy candidate on to the Mouths in the Chambers.
case ht_join
run
player->PositionCell 5583 5900 12650 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Entrance"
until 600 "TR_m1_Vero_Renim"->GetDistance player < 400
wait 120
talk TR_m1_Vero_Renim
ask join House Telvanni
bye
run
player->PositionCell 275 6977 13830 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Areth_Morvayn"->GetDistance player < 400
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Areth_Morvayn
ask join House Telvanni
choose 2
choose 1
expect player->GetPCRank Telvanni >= 0
bye
end

case ht_ra1_start
talk TR_m1_T_Areth_Morvayn
ask chores
ask report from Vvardenfell
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Ra1 == 10
bye
end

case ht_ra1_contact
run
player->Position 125559 211182 600 0
until 900 "TR_M1_Q66_Ra1_Contact"->GetDistance player < 600
talk TR_M1_Q66_Ra1_Contact
choose 1
until 300 GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Ra1 >= 20
expect player->GetItemCount "TR_M1_Q66_GHT_Ra1_Report" >= 1
end

case ht_ra1_report
run
player->PositionCell 275 6977 13830 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Areth_Morvayn"->GetDistance player < 400
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Areth_Morvayn
ask report from Vvardenfell
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Ra1 == 100
bye
end
